    "body": "Thanks for your interest! However, these are not good changes. The html, head, and body tags are all optional, so adding them is unnecessary. Similarly the p end tag is optional. You added two unclosed b tags which do not make semantic sense. And you changed the timeout, which just makes the animation slower.\r\n\r\nLet's close this, and if you have specific feedback you can open an issue instead of jumping straight to a pull request.",
